+and append the same declaration, preserving order, canonical/display names,
+specifier, exact value, source and current index line/fallback. In particular,
+a bare string version does not gain Poetry's `allow_bare=True` exact credit.
+The existing shared `pipfile.packages` line index for both sections stays;
+this policy does not infer physical entry/version-field line accuracy.
+
+Missing version keys, every string (including empty, whitespace, malformed-looking,
+nonexact or transport-associated strings), whole non-dict package values,
+arrays/multiple constraints, source-only/transport-only mappings and unvisited
+custom categories do not trigger. Do not infer failure from `(None, None)`,
+`exact is None`, diagnostic prose or a package name. These controls do not certify
+manager validity or completeness. Do not coerce or validate strings, enumerate
+new children, add reads/retries/candidates/budgets, run a solver or expand traversal.
